  const HARMLESS = /\b((fight|fights|fighting|kill|kills|killed|killing|hit|hits|hide|hiding|hid|died|die|dead|beat|beats|shoot|shot)\b[^.!?]{0,40}\b(mobs?|zombies?|creepers?|skeletons?|spiders?|endermen|enderman|dragon|wither|warden|boss(es)?|piglins?|pillagers?|raid|the game|minecraft|fortnite|roblox|survival|creative|pvp|level|round|match|team|them in|the other team|a three|three pointer|the ball|a home run|homerun|a goal|the buzzer)|(minecraft|fortnite|roblox|survival mode|in game|in the game|pvp|bedwars|skywars)\b[^.!?]{0,60}\b(fight|fights|fighting|kill|kills|killed|hide|hiding|died|die|dead|beat)|(mom|mum|dad|parents|she|he|they|teacher|coach|sister|brother|mia|grandma)( is| are| will| would|'ll|'d)? (going to|gonna|will|would)? ?(literally |actually |totally )?kill me\b( when| if| for)?|(i'?m|im|i am) (literally |so |actually )?(dying|dead)\b(?= (haha|lol|lmao|this|that|of)| *$)|(going to|gonna|could|want to|about to|will) scream|(is|are|he is|she is|you are|hes|shes|youre) (so+|totally|literally|sooo+) dead|(pillow|food|snowball|water balloon|nerf|thumb|play) fights?|(nerf|water|glue|toy|squirt|laser|paintball) guns?|hide and seek|(nobody|no one|noone|nothing) (is |was |got |gets )?(getting |going to get |gonna get )?(hurt|dead|died)|(not|never|didn'?t|doesn'?t|won'?t|wasn'?t|isn'?t|am not|im not|i'?m not) (\w+ )?hurt\w*( myself| me)?|(part|test|exam|quiz|question|questions|practice|workout|homework|class|essay|project|math|chem|chemistry|physics|run|drill|drills|training|game|match|this|that|it|coach|school|work|shift)( literally| actually| lowkey| honestly| really| kinda)? (killed|is killing|was killing|killing) me|(run|ran|do|did|doing|running|made us (do|run)|make us (do|run)) (like )?(\d+ |twenty |fifty |ten |a bunch of )?suicides|suicide (drills?|sprints?|runs?|line)|touch(es|ed|ing)? (her|his|my|your|their) (phone|stuff|things|room|toys|games|ipad|tablet|switch|food|makeup|clothes|charger|laptop|headphones|bike|hair|cards|lego|legos)|(phone|battery|laptop|computer|ipad|tablet|controller|switch|console|plant|plants|flowers?) (is |was |just )?(dead|died)|dying (of|from) (laugh\w*|embarrassment|boredom|curiosity)|dying to|killing it|killed it|(fell|falling|fall) asleep|scared (of )?(spiders?|the dark|heights|clowns|snakes|bugs|dogs|thunder)|afraid (of )?(spiders?|the dark|heights|clowns|snakes|bugs)|(fat|skinny) (cat|dog|hamster|cheeks|pig|chance)|(rose|garden|tree|plant|grass|hair|paper|finger) ?cut|haircut|cut (the|my|a|some|it|down|out)\s*(cake|grass|hair|paper|pizza|tree|trees|wood|picture|shape|shapes)?)\b/g;
